{"lines":[{"x":0.12730004490982849,"t":"Audioscripts","c":1,"y":0.10193297104653087,"w":0.11370150248209637,"h":0.014528249823724138},{"y":0.1468023253606241,"t":"SALLY:","x":0.12757201664704373,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.045267489751180001},{"t":"JOE:","h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.17732558128790987,"x":0.12962962958561774,"w":0.030864197413126626,"c":1},{"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.20494186036379736,"c":1,"t":"SALLY:","x":0.12962962929127383},{"w":0.030864197413126626,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"JOE:","y":0.234011627788967,"x":0.1296296296230289,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512463,"t":"SALLY:","x":0.12962962950171128,"y":0.24854651150970153,"w":0.045267489751180001,"c":1},{"t":"JOE:","x":0.12962962961648195,"y":0.27761627892746477,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"w":0.030864197413126626},{"y":0.29215116265852004,"c":1,"t":"SALLY:","x":0.12757201634330084,"w":0.045267489751180029,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"JOE:","w":0.02880658467610675,"y":0.30668604638965413,"c":1,"x":0.12962962941091782},{"c":1,"t":"SALLY:","x":0.12757201634330084,"y":0.32122093010038044,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.045267489751180029},{"y":0.35029069756490339,"w":0.030864197413126626,"h":0.008720930389296333,"c":1,"t":"JOE:","x":0.12962962959296637},{"t":"SALLY:","y":0.37790697652341476,"w":0.045267489751180029,"x":0.12757201668819598,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"t":"JOE:","x":0.12962962992855326,"y":0.42151162764597239,"w":0.030864197413126626},{"w":0.047325102488199877,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.43604651145074036,"c":1,"t":"SALLY:","x":0.12757201672143503},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.028806584676106778,"t":"JOE.","c":1,"x":0.12962962936976555,"y":0.45203488361141486},{"t":"SALLY:","x":0.12757201655425399,"w":0.047325102488199849,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.46511627893758978},{"c":1,"t":"JOE:","x":0.12757201666080406,"w":0.032921810150146474,"y":0.50872093009488006,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"y":0.52325581382256914,"w":0.047325102488199877,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"SALLY:","x":0.12757201655893036,"c":1},{"t":"JOE:","h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.55523255803209592,"c":1,"w":0.030864197413126626,"x":0.12962962958561774},{"w":0.59876541137695316,"x":0.22016461930387435,"y":0.14534883707598545,"h":0.014545155919482688,"c":1,"t":"So as far as the responsibilities for this position go, they want someone who can"},{"x":0.21810699015049417,"w":0.37037038167317704,"y":0.16133720918022965,"c":1,"t":"manage the stock, obviously, and also deliveries.","h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.59053497314453129,"y":0.1743227327285255,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.21810699892009702,"t":"That should be OK. You've got to keep track of stuff, but l've always been quite","c":1},{"x":0.2199573070364006,"y":0.18906159447492643,"h":0.013079828592576725,"t":"good with numbers.","c":1,"w":0.15053407033284505},{"h":0.016020899526643206,"x":0.22016461161396042,"t":"Good. that's their first requirement. And they want someone who's computer","w":0.56995885213216146,"c":1,"y":0.20200235566948677},{"t":"literate, which we know you are.","x":0.2199641900047383,"c":1,"w":0.24316983540852868,"h":0.014902101388668432,"y":0.21793150832802755},{"h":0.012351896512915572,"c":1,"y":0.23219614471659855,"w":0.042945667902628604,"t":"Sure.","x":0.22132552073898665},{"w":0.53703704833984367,"y":0.24705535916500765,"x":0.21810699013088539,"c":1,"h":0.014572547939556646,"t":"Then they mention organisational skills. They want someone who's well"},{"x":0.22010143995718542,"w":0.0824308649698893,"y":0.261400518975065,"c":1,"t":"organised.","h":0.012082682902737174},{"t":"Yes, I think I am.","h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.12757202148437499,"x":0.2201646063834852,"c":1,"y":0.27616279056334969},{"t":"And tidy?","y":0.29049675566067046,"w":0.074214235941569034,"c":1,"x":0.21803691485088458,"h":0.013483232828416569},{"w":0.29835390726725269,"x":0.218106996880777,"y":0.30523255800383753,"h":0.014555427856804748,"t":"Yes, they go together really, don't they?","c":1},{"x":0.21805268151213342,"y":0.31818780300172134,"h":0.015291742497816063,"c":1,"w":0.59477701822916662,"t":"Sure. Then the usual stuff; they want someone who can communicate well both"},{"c":1,"x":0.22016460902910898,"y":0.3342167256131614,"h":0.011778563015312216,"t":"orally and in writing.","w":0.15226337432861328},{"w":0.58436213175455731,"c":1,"y":0.34738372080962243,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"OK. And for the last warehouse job I had, one of the things I enjoyed most was","x":0.22222222619802626},{"t":"being part of a team. I found that was really essential for the job","x":0.22016461271821952,"y":0.36336866912433274,"w":0.47530863444010418,"c":1,"h":0.011631330977620591},{"c":1,"w":0.59876541137695316,"t":"Excellent. Yes, they do mention that they want someone who's used to that, yes.","x":0.22222223248438128,"y":0.37632508819262589,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"x":0.22016460303491367,"y":0.39098837197095859,"w":0.59465021769205728,"h":0.013081395583944833,"c":1,"t":"Now when you were working in a warehouse last time, what sorts of items were"},{"h":0.011778563015312216,"t":"you dealing with?","x":0.22016461008379484,"y":0.40694935204936789,"w":0.13168724060058595,"c":1},{"w":0.57818929036458333,"c":1,"t":"It was mostly bathroom and kitchen equipment, sinks and stoves and fridges.","y":0.42005813941321635,"x":0.22016461402067439,"h":0.013098515666696509},{"x":0.22016461060276579,"y":0.43459302309828218,"w":0.26954732259114589,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"t":"So you're OK moving heavy things?"},{"x":0.22222222744974901,"y":0.44905771518982007,"t":"Sure. I'm quite strong, and l've had the training.","h":0.013250883392226021,"w":0.35390945434570314,"c":1},{"x":0.22222223435988819,"c":1,"y":0.46366279057771598,"w":0.5864197285970052,"t":"Good. Now as far as experience goes, they mention they want someone with a","h":0.013081395583944611},{"c":1,"t":"licence, and that you have experience of driving in London - so you can cope","x":0.22016461392264661,"y":0.47819767429753446,"w":0.57818929036458333,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"y":0.49161373489865356,"h":0.012846959072512987,"t":"with the traffic and so on.","x":0.22004636662995192,"c":1,"w":0.19165837605794273},{"t":"Yes, no problem.","c":1,"x":0.21771724634961284,"y":0.50704704288491187,"w":0.1324239730834961,"h":0.016365318051215771},{"h":0.01309337941721278,"t":"And you've got experience of warehouse work... and the final thing they mention","x":0.22016460109855795,"y":0.52179034162827853,"w":0.60699590047200525,"c":1},{"x":0.21810699137917935,"w":0.4732510375976563,"y":0.53621908107345773,"h":0.011778563015312216,"t":"is customer service. I think looking at your CV you're OK there.","c":1},{"w":0.56378601074218748,"t":"Right. So what about pay? Can you tell me a bit more about that, please ...","h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.21810699451132828,"y":0.55232558125529529,"c":1},{"t":"PART 2","c":1,"x":0.12949106581857109,"h":0.015484709340916614,"y":0.59836229616610059,"w":0.096984945933024092},{"y":0.62632508820654564,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"PRESENTER: My guest on the show today is Alice Riches who started the Street Play Scheme","c":1,"x":0.12962961760294017,"w":0.68930043538411456},{"t":"where she lives in Beechwood Road. For those of you that don't already know -","x":0.22016461490896347,"y":0.64098837198619607,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.57201644897460946},{"t":"Street Play involves local residents closing off their street for a few hours so","y":0.65304982414956825,"w":0.56597452799479164,"x":0.22010078574201619,"h":0.015500436542452589,"c":1},{"h":0.014552004064912638,"y":0.66860465102679223,"c":1,"x":0.21810698989425484,"t":"that children have a chance to play in the street safely. She started it in her own","w":0.59465021769205728},{"x":0.21810699704345343,"t":"street, Beechwood Road, and the idea caught on, and there are now Street Play","y":0.68313953475023326,"w":0.60288065592447926,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"w":0.56995885213216146,"t":"Schemes all over the city. So when did you actually start the scheme, Alice?","h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.2181069935845005,"y":0.69758539482737769,"c":1},{"w":0.045267489751180001,"y":0.71366279044783343,"t":"ALICE:","x":0.12757201680136471,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.71202766360672343,"h":0.014574515945919853,"t":"Well, I first had the idea when my oldest child was still a toddler, so that's about","x":0.22011637284225874,"w":0.59269531250000007},{"h":0.014541732127590579,"y":0.72673733776465255,"w":0.56378601074218748,"c":1,"t":"six years ago now - but it took at least two years of campaigning before we","x":0.21810699459433824},{"h":0.01582175795124896,"x":0.21803998130768301,"c":1,"t":"were actually able to make it happen. So the scheme's been up and running for","y":0.74030588242830053,"w":0.59683771769205729},{"y":0.75581395336781798,"t":"three years now. We'd love to be able to close our road for longer - for the whole","w":0.60288065592447915,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.22016461023055323},{"y":0.77031802127682303,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.22016461586812958,"w":0.56584360758463537,"c":1,"t":"weekend, from Saturday morning until Sunday evening, for example. At the"},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.60699590047200513,"y":0.78474676070980343,"x":0.22016460111405972,"c":1,"t":"moment it's just once a week. But when we started it was only once a month. But"},{"x":0.22016460998495949,"y":0.79941860453681646,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"we're working on it.","w":0.1460905329386393},{"x":0.12962963000040664,"t":"PRESENTER:","y":0.81540697665434192,"w":0.080246912638346352,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"t":"ALICE:","c":1,"y":0.82994186031009554,"x":0.12962962938129441,"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"So what actually happens when Beechwood Road is closed?","x":0.22222221238636913,"w":0.45267491658528652,"y":0.81389870422481037},{"c":1,"y":0.82848837198649106,"x":0.22016460204154156,"w":0.60082305908203126,"t":"We have volunteer wardens, mostly parents but some elderly residents too, who","h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.8430232556940298,"w":0.60493825276692703,"t":"block off our road at either end. The council have provided special signs but there's","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.22016461836291323},{"w":0.59259256998697918,"t":"always a volunteer there to explain what's happening to any motorists. Generally,","h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.22016462028385339,"y":0.8574793877209782,"c":1},{"w":0.5617284138997396,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"they're fine about it - we've only had to get the police involved once or twice.","x":0.220164599527259,"y":0.87209302314908566},{"x":0.12962963001089212,"w":0.03497942288716635,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.92005813937645065,"t":"108"},{"y":0.15988372077729074,"w":0.02880658467610675,"x":0.86213991743560925,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"Q6"},{"w":0.02880658467610675,"t":"Q7","x":0.86213991744496188,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.28924418586949696},{"c":1,"t":"Q8","x":0.86419753096735763,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.36191860447910318},{"x":0.86419753095800467,"t":"Q9","y":0.43459302309846759,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.8580246919615695,"y":0.53633720916149619,"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q10"},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.86008230469173064,"w":0.032921810150146502,"t":"Q11","c":1,"y":0.74127906962418988},{"t":"Q12","x":0.8580246919615695,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.7703488370684729,"c":1},{"t":"Q13","x":0.8580246919615695,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"y":0.82848837195219383}],"w":2400,"h":3395}